# Line endings, fixed at LF.
#
# The repository already stores LF, but with no `.gitattributes` a Windows
# checkout under the default `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites every file to CRLF
# on the way out. Prettier defaults to `endOfLine: "lf"`, so `pnpm format:check`
# then reports all 215 files as unformatted on a Windows machine and passes on
# Linux CI — a check that disagrees with itself by platform is a check people
# learn to ignore.
#
# `eol=lf` makes the working tree match what is stored, everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never converted and never diffed as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary

# Generated. Collapsed in review, because nobody reads a lockfile diff.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
